Prove (the `poisson-prove` package)
https://github.com/poisson-labs/prove
First party: Poisson Labs. Distributed on PyPI as the poisson-prove distribution and a
declared dependency of this package: Trace reads poisson-prove 0.4.0 or later (see
README, "Install"). Poisson Trace reads Prove's stored runs through Prove's public
API and copies none of its code; the estimators here are written independently and are
pinned equal to Prove's on shared inputs by the test suite.

